<figcaption><strong>Encode / decode, nanoseconds per message, lower is better.</strong></figcaption>
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 380 210" font-family="var(--font-sans, system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif)" role="img" aria-label="Encode / decode, nanoseconds per message, lower is better.">
