<p class="bench-note">Sans-io inbound dispatch, engine only with no sockets: 3,614,977 turns/s. Sparse export-table insert: 69.5 ns.</p>
```

# [Per-connection footprint]($section.id('per-connection-footprint'))

`bench-peer-scaling` counts inline and heap memory in four states: idle,
warmed, sixteen calls in flight, and hosted with a vat. The half-million column
is arithmetic over core memory, not a live network test.

