# [Cost through each language binding]($section.id('cost-through-each-language-binding'))

One native Zig host stays fixed while the client changes. Each row includes a
runtime, binding, application, and garbage collector. Goblins is an outside
CapTP peer. Method details are in the
[bench README](https://github.com/jimisaacs/glowcap/blob/main/bench/langs/README.md).

