# [Time-travel: snapshot and restore]($section.id('time-travel-snapshot-and-restore'))

This sweep varies actor count and bytes per actor. glowcap and Goblins run on
different runtimes, so compare how cost scales with actor count rather than
their absolute times. Cost grows with the number of objects.

